=Laboratory=
{{img:units/Laboratory.png}}
*  Health: 16
*  Price: %Minerals% 80
*  [[concepts/sensory|Scanning range]]: 2
*  Consumes: %Energy%10
Laboratories research new components and buildings, or improve their attributes. Each enabled laboratory contributes 1 research point per round to the currently selected faction research goal. Research aimed at unlocking new components requires a number of research points to be accumulated. Research aimed at improvement will continuously improve the selected property, but become increasingly less efficient the further research has progressed. As a result, research facilities are a continuous construction effort and you will most likely never have enough.
